At $110 million, the blockchain and DeFi fund is practically half of the SCB 10X’s $220 million equity capital fund. Commenting on the size of the allotment to digital properties, Panich stated that it was a reflection of the bank’s dedication to the DeFi area, including:
Panich likewise echoed comparable beliefs, informing CryptoPumpNews: “I want to point out that I really see a future where traditional financial companies will work together with DeFi companies. My view is that in the future, there will be an integration of traditional finance with DeFi.”
