Cryptocurrency pump is a trading stage during which the value of coins is artificially pumped by activating multiple buy orders. This increases the interest of traders in the sharp rise in the currency in the market, which attracts them to participate in trading.
With the help of trading manipulations, they manage to raise the demand for their chosen cryptocurrency. When the price for a coin reaches the target, a quick sale of coins is organized, and the organizers of the pump get huge profits.
An increase in the value of a coin within 5 minutes is very rare, therefore, on the statistical chart, one can usually observe 1-3 long green candles, which are replaced by a red period. Correction sometimes occurs, which explains the appearance of several up and down waves, medium and small volume.
Of course, you can track the upcoming pump yourself, but in this case, it is most rational to bet on several coins at once that can participate in the rise. The main signs of an approaching pump may be “flat” and almost complete absence of trading during the day.
At first glance, it may seem that in order to get decent earnings on the Binance exchange, it is enough just to find out information about the upcoming pump, “go from the bottom and get your 20-30%” of guaranteed profit. The main difficulty for a trader is that it is technically very difficult to “go from below”.
At the same time, the user can easily raise a small amount on kickbacks from changes in the value of digital coins, which will not be difficult to track. Inside information will help you prepare in advance for the upcoming trade, minimizing the risks of losing.
