A digital assets platform has launched an Americas unit as part of its global expansion.
Led by Fernando Martínez, OSL Americas delivers prime brokerage — including electronic and over-the-counter execution as well as coin borrowing and lending. It is also set to serve as a regional hub for engagement with the company’s software-as-a-service partners.
