In some cases, abnormally high tweet volume can signify that a property will skyrocket, however traders need to mind the context.
On Crypto Twitter, a rise of attention directed at a coin typically is available in action to significant cost action. Quite naturally, rallying properties draw in the attention of traders and take control of Twitter discussions, which can likewise develop favorable feedback loops that even more prop up the momentum.
