Exclusively readily available to Crypto PumpNews Markets Pro (CTMP) customers, the algorithm evaluates criteria such as the marketplace outlook, cost motion, social belief and trading activity to produce a rating that demonstrates how appropriate conditions of the observed mixes are for any coin at any provided time.
Here are 3 examples from the last thirty days where Twitter activity foreshadowed cost action.
In the case ofCrypto com Coin (CRO), the source of Twitter users’ enjoyment is clear: A couple of hours prior to the coin flashed on Markets Pro’s Unusual Twitter Volume box (red circle in the chart), it emerged that CRO ended up being the very first digital property platform to partner with the Ultimate Fighting Championship, or UFC. The statement was likewise provided to Markets Pro users seconds after the initial source released it, thanks to the platform’s instant NewsQuakes ™ performance.
