WhatsApp has a significant legion of users behind it, many of whom have advanced knowledge of development and programming. This is what has caused a stream of modifications to the WhatsApp application to emerge, this is exactly WhatsApp Plus, a modification of WhatsApp that allows us, for example, to hide our connection status permanently, customize the design or add functions that it lacks.
Android users can download this version to their phone, normally using an APK. When updating, you have to manually install the new version, because this version not updated through Google Play, as it happens in the normal version of the application.
Also known as GBWhatsApp, it is another mod of the messaging application. It is a modified version that allows users to modify some functions and the appearance of the application on the phone.
This version of the application it can be downloaded this link, where we also have access to the new versions that are being launched, where new functions and various improvements are incorporated into it. Again, it is released in APK format and we will have to manually download the new versions, since it is not updated through Google Play.
