The APK of this modified version of the application can be downloaded at this link. When updating you have to manually download each new APK that is being launched from WhatsApp aero to be able to enjoy the news that is incorporated into it.
The last of the application mods is presented as an option stable, clean, safe and easy to use. There are quite a few privacy options in it, which allow setting privacy levels in the groups or individual chats that are had in the app itself.
As with the rest of the modified versions of the application, you have to download the new APK manually every time there is a new update available. It is not updated by Google Play like the normal version of the application.
