We are going with a new compilation post. This time we list some of the best and most popular bike games for Android, so get ready to grab one or more of the most played BMX titles on mobile.
Now we go with the list of the best bike games for Android smartphones. It is worth noting and repeating, as we always do, thatall the ones you will find in this compilation post are free.Therefore, you will not have to fork out any amount of money to get one or all of them.
We start this compilation post with Touchgrind BMX 2, a very popular title that already has more than 10 million accumulated downloads in the Play Store alone, and not for nothing, since it is one of the most fun and entertaining games that deals with bicycles, tricks, stunts, cartwheels and plus.
Your fingers are the character that controls the bicycle, since it goes alone. Ride it, pick up speed and jump on extreme ramps, but yes, try not to fall, since you would give yourself a good blow, because you have to descend from heights that exceed 50 meters and more.
As its name indicates, This is a title with animations and 3D graphics that are quite well-crafted. Here you must be the fastest of all, because in this game you must compete with other players and reach the goal before the others, which is not usually entirely simple since there are several obstacles on the different tracks, ranging from forests even deserts and snow.
You must get all the stars that you can, but at the same time you also have to avoid obstacles, perform jumps and not fall, since that will delay you and, therefore, your time will be longer, which is not good. Play on ice rinks, desert, mountains, forests and many more; there is nothing monotonous in this game.
The fourth set of bikes on this listing is Max Air BMX, a title that already has more than 1 million downloads and weighs about 90 MB.
You can choose between 12 different bikes to get the one you like the most and compete; Of course, you must first unlock them progressively, as you progress through the game. You can also make use of up to 5 different characters, all with crazy looks and styles and extreme enough so that you are the center of attention in each competition and jump.
To finish this compilation post of the best bicycle games for Android, we have: BMX FE3D 2 - Freestyle Extreme 3D. This is another title that has 3D graphics and very realistic animations.
Finally, you can make your character level up, but for this you must earn skill points, something that you can only obtain through tricks and feats.
