One of the many WhatsApp options is the creation of groups of up to 256 people, a fairly large number. The possibility of creating and managing them is quite simple.
2.1 First steps of the installation
With our simple tutorials we will teach you how to install WhatsApp on all your devices, so you don't miss a single moment of communication with yours:
Not only that, but we help you install it for free. We recall that after its acquisition by Facebook, the company WhatsApp Inc has eliminated any type of charge for the use of its services, therefore, WhatsApp is totally free.
The official WhatsApp page allows the download of the latest version of this well-known application that already has more than 2.000 million active users around the world since its inception. Today we are going to show you how to download and install it on your Android device in a few simple steps.
In order to install we have to allow the APKs to be installable due to the security of the operating system. To do this, we will access "Security" and activate it in Unknown sources, Google will notify you that you are exposed to the fact that its operation could not be correct, but remember that the APK application is the same one offered by the Google Play Store.
Once it is open, we must accept the conditions of service, click on accept for the next step.
