GBWhatsApp is one of the best known unofficial WhatsApp mods for Android. Among its improvements are new features and extra functions exclusively with its installation.
It has endless features, it is one of the best mods that you can try and from which you can take advantage of all the extra functions included by the developer.
The installation represents an important change, above all it emphasizes aesthetics and offering a quality result. It has similar functions to the others, but it is differentiated by the complete customization of your WhatsApp application once you install it.
Add lots of new emoticons and emojis to make your conversations more fun. Among other important functions to highlight is being able to send files of up to 1 GB or more than 100 photos or images at once.
Currently, WhatsApp Plus is fully available despite the pressure that the creators of WhatsApp have exerted to try to remove this "mod" from all download servers. Thanks to this modified version of Whatsapp We can customize the way others see us connected, have several conversations open at the same time, and even modify where each icon appears within the application.
Before download WhatsApp Plus free and install it, first of all we will make a backup of all WhatsApp chats, for this we go to: WhatsApp Settings> Chat Settings> Save Conversations. Once saved, we proceed to uninstall the application.
We will have to wait a few minutes for the backup of chats that we have made later in one of the first steps to be restored. We will automatically see the new functions top right, in the new WhatsApp icon with the "+" symbol in the center.
